# Claude Code workspace — local only, never committed or pushed (Bashar, 2026-07-29).
# Holds the project rules (.claude/CLAUDE.md) and decision records (.claude/memory/).
# Consequence: these are NOT shared via the repo. Distribute them out of band.
.claude/

# Root CLAUDE.md only imports .claude/CLAUDE.md, which is ignored above — committing
# it would leave a dangling reference in a fresh clone.
CLAUDE.md

# Local object storage (development only)
.storage/
